    overview: {
      heading: 'About Dynapharm Kenya',
      p1: 'Dynapharm Kenya serves customers and distributors through 18 DPC locations across the Republic of Kenya. The network is anchored in Nairobi and extends to major towns and trading corridors including Mombasa, Kisumu, Nakuru, Eldoret, Thika, Nyeri, Kitale, Ruiru, Kitengela, Voi and Murang\'a.',
      p2: 'DPC locations support access to Dynapharm\'s catalogue of natural health products, including Spirulina, Ganoderma coffees, Liquid Chlorophyll, herbal supplements, personal care products and D.I. Grow agricultural bio-fertiliser.',
